{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g4-pro-koko-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G4 Pro Koko 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn G4 PRO KOKO Pod System in Kenya, featuring up to 35W of power, a 2000mAh battery, smart touchscreen, and customizable output mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Caliburn GPP replacement pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn G3 replacement pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlongside the Storm Mode for throat hits and Waves Mode for smoother flavor, the Customize Mode lets you tailor your hits and flavor to your liking. The first-ever KOKO touchscreen provides instant feedback, allowing you to switch output modes, adjust wattage, and more with a single tap, while featuring 5 Blind Draw UI themes to collect. Compatible with both Caliburn GPP and G3 pods, the G4 PRO KOKO gives you options.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUWELL CALIBURN G4 PRO KOKO 35W POD SYSTEM FEATURES:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 85.8mm x 50mm x 23mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 2000mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 35W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDISPLAY SCREEN: 2\" Touchscreen\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD SUPPORT: Caliburn GPP \/ G3 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u